    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2WvunRxqLgBGFzjJ85aXPfJ)_\n\n## Why\n\nAfter pointing Hammerspoon at `~/.config/hammerspoon`, it failed with `init.lua:3: attempt to index a boolean value (global 'stackline')`. `require \"stackline\"` finds the empty top-level `stackline.lua` (it returns `true`), so `stackline:init()` errors, and the AeroSpace keys on the last line never load. That is why Caps Lock and Option did nothing for AeroSpace.\n\n## What\n\n- `init.lua` requires `aerospace-keys` first.\n- stackline is loaded inside `pcall`; a failure is printed to the Console (`stackline not loaded: ...`) and no longer stops anything.\n\n## Not fixed\n\nstackline itself stays broken: `stackline.lua` is empty and `lib/` is called `stackline-lib/` in this folder, so it does not match the layout stackline expects. Say if you want it repaired or removed.\n\nNot run (no Hammerspoon in the container). After merging and `git pull` in `~/dotfiles`, reload the config and hold Caps Lock + `l`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAZg8pR9NBT6MCe97U)_",
